sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant CMP_KTL_003 as Controller
  participant CMP_KTL_002 as Temperature sensor
  User->>CMP_KTL_003: water_temp_c
  CMP_KTL_002->>CMP_KTL_003: INT-KTL-001 Temperature readings
  Note over CMP_KTL_003: When water_temp_c >= 100 turn heater off
  CMP_KTL_003-->>User: heater_off, done_beep
